{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38421","headline":"雪十韵 · 吴融","name":"雪十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洒密蔽璇穹，霏霏杳莫穷。\n迟於雨到地，疾甚絮随风。\n四野苍茫际，千家晃朗中。\n夜迷三绕鹊，昼断一行鸿。\n结片飞琼树，栽花点蘂宫。\n壅应边尽北，填合海无东。\n高爱危峰积，低愁暖气融。\n月交都浩渺，日射更𤫩珑\n送腊辞寒律，迎春入旧丛。\n自怜曾末至，聊复赋玄功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}